OL,3,GNEWSAOak tree saved after two-year
OL,4,Acampaign
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 100-year-old oak tree threatened with
OL,7,Ffelling over subsidence concerns has
OL,8,Fbeen saved after a two-year campaign by
OL,9,Fresidents.
OL,11,FThe tree, known locally as Oakley,
OL,12,Fstands near Acorn Avenue and Willow
OL,13,FDrive in Cowfold and had been due to be
OL,14,Fcut down in August 2024.
OL,16,FInstead, a root barrier has been
OL,17,Finstalled to protect a nearby property
OL,18,Fwhile allowing the tree to remain.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
